      "summary": "19 km underground/surface LRT along Eglinton Avenue. Originally budgeted at $5.3B (2010), now estimated $12.8B+. Originally due 2020, repeatedly delayed. Crosslinx consortium and Metrolinx in ongoing legal disputes. Construction has caused years of disruption to Eglinton corridor businesses. Multiple contractor claims and design defects reported.",
